    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Continental Airlines\nSystem Timetable\nServing over 190 destinations worldwide.\nEffective March 1, 1998.\nFlying even further.\nCalgary • Caracas • Dublin • Glasgow\nHalifax • Mérida • Ottawa • Santiago\nShannon • Tampico • Veracruz.\nContinental\nAirlines\nRoutes subject to government approval.",
      "For reservations call your\ntravel agent or\n1-800-523-FARE\n(1-800-523-3273)\nFor complete vacation packages\ncall Continental Airlines Vacations at\n1-800-634-5555\nFor automated flight\ninformation call\n1-800-784-4444\nAlways ask for an\n#TICKET.\nInternet address\nwww.flycontinental.com\nContinental\nAirlines"
    ],
